    "body": "fix on issue/1708-straight-gap-link · PR #1713 · pinned by jump_chains_at_the_retract_plane, straight_links_holes_at_the_run_height, straight_links_keep_the_ball_out_of_the_plate, straight_refused_over_a_biting_slot_keeps_the_hop, straight_refused_with_no_saving_below_keeps_the_jump_bytes, the_back_run_of_a_broken_line_crosses_its_gaps_not_the_field · merges when reviewed\n\nThe PR carries only this change on top of main at 101d82f9. The dropdown holds the two options the issue names: `Jump` (default, the old hop, byte-for-byte) and `Straight`. The old three-option experiment is not in the diff. The head branch is on the tbrasselle/Camcraft fork because this account has no write access here; labels on this issue and PR still need a collaborator.\n",
